  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛的用心製作。Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 有許多的活動性模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Recipe Commands 是一個以非侵入式的方式來查找遊戲中任何配方的原材料和花紋的模塊。只需使用命令<strong><em>/recipes</em></strong>（或者簡寫<strong><em>/rec</em></strong>）並跟隨物品名稱。自動完成功能支持查找確切的名字。對於新手玩家學習配方而無需離開遊戲，或者是忘記了稀有物品配方的高手來說非常有用。<br><br>顯示的花紋中的下劃線 ( _ ) 代表一個空格。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：服務器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"命令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>&lt;recipe&gt;</em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 顯示配方的原材料和花紋。</span><br><em>/rec &lt;recipe&gt;</em></span> - 顯示配方的原材料和花紋。</p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">具有自動完成配方的 /recipes 命令：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"655\"><br><br>活塞的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"673\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紅石復發器的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"601\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">箭矢的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"639\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">終結箱的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"595\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金合歡舟的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"503\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">盔甲架的配方：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/recipe-commands/g.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"597\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"註釋和鏈接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何模塊包中使用此模塊，只要下載保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模塊的概述和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">註釋已禁用，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模塊頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如果有問題、想法、建議或其他任何情況，請參照&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github repo</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
